ank" rel="noopener" style="width:24px;border-width:0px;border:0px;"><img src="/ext/static.hubspot.com/final/img/common/icons/social/twitter-24x24.png" class="hs-image-widget hs-image-social-sharing-24" style="max-height:24px;max-width:24px;border-width:0px;border:0px;" width="24" hspace="0" alt="Share on Twitter" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp;<a href="mailto:?subject=Check%20out%20https%3A%2F%2Ffreerange.com%2Fblog%2Fi-know-where-i-stand-taonga-leslie-on-diversity-equity-and-inclusion-in-the-age-of-trump%3Futm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_source%3Demail%20&amp;body=Check%20out%20https%3A%2F%2Ffreerange.com%2Fblog%2Fi-know-where-i-stand-taonga-leslie-on-diversity-equity-and-inclusion-in-the-age-of-trump%3Futm_medium%3Dsocial%26utm_source%3Demail" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="width:24px;border-width:0px;border:0px;"><img src="/ext/static.hubspot.com/final/img/common/icons/social/email-24x24.png" class="hs-image-widget hs-image-social-sharing-24" style="max-height:24px;max-width:24px;border-width:0px;border:0px;" width="24" hspace="0" alt="Share on Email" loading="lazy"></a></span>
